message: "Please cite the version of Marmoset Atlas Mapper used in your research. A Zenodo version DOI will be added after the archive is prepared."
type: software
title: "Marmoset Atlas Mapper"
version: 0.3.2
authors:
  - family-names: Yagishita
    given-names: Haruya
repository-code: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
url: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Windows software for CT-to-atlas mapping using six marmoset references,
  landmark-based or standalone ANTs registration, and equal-weight averaging
  of point-forward mappings. The MIT License applies to original application
  source code only. Bundled atlas data, reference data and third-party software
  retain their separately documented rights and licenses.
keywords:
  - marmoset
  - brain atlas
  - CT
  - image registration
